    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-guttifera-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-pearson-r-of-numerical-vs-analytical-wavelength-across-dv-sweep-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        schema:value "0.98" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-guttifera-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-rmse-of-numerical-vs-analytical-wavelength> a schema:PropertyValue,
